# boxselect (kenshi-k16.2.230.1; kenshi-k16.2.230.3 adds the dead and KO'd members): five of the player's characters in a row on open ground with
# two same-faction NPCs standing among them, for the selection-box check (run.sh). The NPCs are not the player's (player=0): a box over them must not
# select them. DeadOne (dead=1) is a player character too: a box over its point leaves it out (kenshi-rwh.134). KOOne (ko=60) lies down but is boxed.
